---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Work | Ethnoir"
  description="What Ethnoir has delivered, what the evidence supports and what it learned from its six-week Venture Readiness Lab pilot."
>
  <!-- SECTION 1: OPENING -->
  <section class="bg-parchment" style="padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl) 0;">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <!-- Masterhead Headline -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-11" style="padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <h1 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); margin: 0; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          What Ethnoir has delivered, and what it learned.
        </h1>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Offset Intro Block -->
      <div class="col-12 grid-12" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-top: var(--space-lg);">
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate);">Our Work</span>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 0; max-width: 720px;">
            Ethnoir’s completed work is shown with what was delivered, what the evidence supports and what is still unresolved.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: PRINCIPAL COMPLETED CASE -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate);">Completed pilot</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          From Business Problems to Practical Structure
        </h2>
        
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); max-width: 720px;">
          What a six-week founder pilot taught Ethnoir about the gap between spotting a business problem and putting a useful fix in place.
        </p>
        
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); padding-left: var(--space-lg); max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            The Venture Readiness Lab was a six-week virtual pilot for six active founders. Ethnoir combined a shared program structure with individual work on each founder’s own business problem.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            All six reached the final session, and five had structural deliverables that Ethnoir’s Founder reviewed and confirmed. The pilot is practical evidence about moving from a visible problem to a working fix, and about what must be tested before any broader claim or scale.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-3" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin-bottom: 0;">
            This activity received support from NC IDEA.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/our-work/venture-readiness-lab" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain);">Read the full case study &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: RELATED ROUTES -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate);">Related routes</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
        <div class="grid-12" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
          <div class="col-12 md-col-6 padding-right-md border-right-md" style="padding-top: var(--space-md); padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
              <a href="/for-organizations" style="color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none;">For Organizations &rarr;</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-muted-slate);">
              Examine the connection between participant needs and the support offered, and explore practical decisions about design, delivery and measurement.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 md-col-6 padding-left-md" style="padding-top: var(--space-md); padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
              <a href="/venture-readiness-check-in" style="color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none;">Venture Readiness Check-In &rarr;</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-muted-slate);">
              A short resource for deciding what to look at next in your business.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .col-12 { grid-column: span 12; }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .md-col-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .md-col-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .md-col-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
    .md-col-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .md-col-11 { grid-column: span 11; }
    .border-right-md { border-right: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); }
    .padding-right-md { padding-right: var(--space-lg); }
    .padding-left-md { padding-left: var(--space-lg); }
  }
</style>
